      "extract": "Ever since its birth knot theory attracted attention of physicists, and various knot invariants turned out to have physical interpretation. In particular various knot polynomials have been reinterpreted as expectation values in Chern-Simons theory in [@Witten_Jones], and subsequently they were expressed in terms of topological string theory amplitudes [@Witten:1992fb]. In [@OoguriV] the topological string setup was",
